# Concrete inner actors at the four Held representative planes

Actual conjugacies transfer the fixed representative's normalizer equality
to all four candidate two-groups. Kernel-checked point colorings force every
actor in each two-group to preserve both marked axes. Explicit words independently
negate those axes. The chapter adapter combines these results for the full inner
pair restriction, with the sole premise N(P)=P.

Sources: GLS3 Table 5.3p; Aschbacher–Smith, printed pp.509–511; unchanged
ATLAS HeG1-p2058B0 permutations. See InnerImages/source/README.md.
-/
